# SYNTHETIC macro. Declares a target that NO acquisition fixture provides.
# Reproduces the real archive's 9 "declared, never acquired" targets — and its 9
# acquisitions with no declared target, which are the same finding from the other
# side. A macro states an INTENTION; that intention and the files that exist
# disagree in both directions, and both must survive.
qdo Ir_XAS.mac

mv Sx -1.25 Sy 2.5 Sz -3.5

newfile 99_09_ZZ3_base_after1500Cycling_filter20_100mV

###      time/point         number of scans
IrL3_xas 0.5      1 		  1050       20

trigger
